{"page":441,"verses":[{"verse_key":"36:13","surah":36,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱضْرِبْ لَهُم مَّثَلًا أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلْقَرْيَةِ إِذْ جَآءَهَا ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Give them the example of the people to whose town messengers came.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱضْرِبْ","en_gloss":"And set forth","transliteration":"wa-iḍ'rib","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّثَلًا","en_gloss":"an example","transliteration":"mathalan","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"(of the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥāba","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the city","transliteration":"l-qaryati","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَآءَهَا","en_gloss":"came to it","transliteration":"jāahā","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-mur'salūna","verse_key":"36:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:13"}]},{"verse_key":"36:14","surah":36,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ أَرْسَلْنَآ إِلَيْهِمُ ٱثْنَيْنِ فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا فَعَزَّزْنَا بِثَالِثٍ فَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّآ إِلَيْكُم مُّرْسَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent two messengers but they rejected both. Then We reinforced them with a third. They said, ‘Truly, we are messengers to you,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhimu","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱثْنَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two (Messengers)","transliteration":"ith'nayni","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا","en_gloss":"but they denied both of them","transliteration":"fakadhabūhumā","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَعَزَّزْنَا","en_gloss":"so We strengthened them","transliteration":"faʿazzaznā","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِثَالِثٍۢ","en_gloss":"with a third","transliteration":"bithālithin","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and they said","transliteration":"faqālū","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّرْسَلُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) Messengers","transliteration":"mur'salūna","verse_key":"36:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:14"}]},{"verse_key":"36:15","surah":36,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ مَآ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُنَا وَمَآ أَنزَلَ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ مِن شَىْءٍ إِنْ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا تَكْذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but they answered, ‘You are only men like ourselves. The Lord of Mercy has sent nothing; you are just lying.'","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"(are) but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَشَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"human beings","transliteration":"basharun","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّثْلُنَا","en_gloss":"like us","transliteration":"mith'lunā","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"36:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"